    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "This heavy flail has shattered shields and broken bone in countless skirmishes. When swung, it releases a bone-shaking resonance that carries further than the strike itself. It stands as a masterwork of destruction, capable of delivering a blow that few can withstand."
